php-vitexsoftware-digest-modules (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * Modular analytics library for accounting systems
  * Core interfaces: ModuleInterface, DataProviderInterface
  * Abstract base classes for rapid module development
  * AbraFlexiDataProvider for AbraFlexi integration
  * Built-in modules: OutcomingInvoices, Debtors
  * PSR-4 autoloading and comprehensive documentation

